rue}, {"path": "/@Ni9oome/works/3", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": true, "creator_id": 3562496, "client_id": 438322, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/04919d5d/uploads/origins/3bade66c-5785-4b58-9bd6-be08ba48eabc?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=34a3ac5ab2cfcc8dbe05a90ae3ae89c5", "src_set": ""}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/04919d5d/uploads/origins/3bade66c-5785-4b58-9bd6-be08ba48eabc?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=8bc4761ab868bdcef105fe7f1bf2cba7", "src_set": ""}, "body": "こんにちは！うちの子のイラストお願いしたいです\nすえさんのこのみのデカさでお願いします！\n首輪も大きめでお願いします🙏\n\nhttps://x.com/minya_0413/status/1303902468145729537?t=qz-q5VqL5yykueiy47zLJw&s=19\n\nご検討よろしくお願いします🙏", "nc": 128, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@Ni9oome/works/2", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 3562496, "client_id": 3171443, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/d2b1bffe/uploads/origins/fc7abdaf-4da3-412f-9fb8-c5e830457dd2?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=329502260ab1615bd5761f4005a38595", "src_set": ""}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/d2b1bffe/uploads/origins/fc7abdaf-4da3-412f-9fb8-c5e830457dd2?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=46ee6c2a463fb2d0579da86385fd625b", "src_set": ""}, "body": "あなたが描いたこのスケッチがとても好きなんだけど、下のツイッターの投稿のように、彼が太っていくシークエンスをやってもらえないかな？\nhttps://x.com/sue36v/status/1897698153568387175\n\nそれから、上に載せたツイッターのリンクのように本当に太っていて、同じような体型で、お腹が少し大きくなっていてほしいです。リファレンスシートの左の服を着ていてもいいですし、服を着ないで描いてもいいです。\n\n僕のキャラクターは、ちょっとうるさい時もあるけど、一度仲良くなると本当にいい人で、食べ物が本当に好きなんだ。\n\nまた、私はしばらくの間、あなたをフォローしています。あなたの脂肪を描く方法がとても好きです。\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/file/d/1Afw3yoZ1MNS_6hbiBnqYF87YxGlbBQT8/view?usp=sharing", "nc": 0, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@Ni9oome/works/1", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 3562496, "client_id": 540698, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/34182c35/uploads/origins/eae5c057-69aa-4482-89ca-94f1bc7cf71a?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=aa63aa436e6978714c94a41e968e94da", "src_set": ""}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/34182c35/uploads/origins/eae5c057-69aa-4482-89ca-94f1bc7cf71a?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=dd1e0e02578959b05f4004a2210ae759", "src_set": ""}, "body": "Hello! I am interested in piece of art from you, I have seen so much of your work and it's all so lovely!\n\nIf it is possible I would love to see this rabbit made large, they are a fighter by trade, so seeing him grow large and struggling with that weight would be very cute to see! \n\nSeeing their body grow to the size shown by your work I've included would be preferred! Thank you very much for your consideration, they alternate between clothing they wear, the choice of which you would like to feature them in is up to your choice! Thank you again for your consideration!\n\nhttps://www.dropbox.com/scl/fo/sse5zonxgcgl3qj4cjrcp/AFNjVCCBDY6zgVHEh08Vcug?rlkey=jkwor6gqmjsk66i0qrbqz8hrd&st=efz2fita&dl=0", "nc": 129, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}], "similar_creators": [{"id": 1958745, "creator": true, "nsfw_acceptable": false, "acceptable": false, "name": "やふくろ", "screen_name": "night_owl_zZ", "avatar_url": "https://proxy.misskeyusercontent.jp/avatar.webp?ur